Package: edgeicg
Type: Package
Title: Spillover-Aware Interaction-Changed Genes at Contact, Paracrine and Niche Scale
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ruben", "Dries", email = "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tests whether a receiver cell type changes a gene's expression with its
    exposure to a sender cell type, at three spatial scales: touching cells (contact),
    short-range neighbours (paracrine) and the regional neighbourhood (niche). Transcripts
    leaked from touching neighbours are modelled from the data and removed per cell before
    testing. Niche effects are screened with a calibrated marginal test (toroidal-shift
    null) and attributed to senders by exact fine-mapping. Counts are read in gene blocks
    through a provider, so whole sections run in bounded memory, in memory or from a
    disk-backed store, sequentially or on 'mirai' daemons.
