Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: Matrix, data.table, methods, RANN, splines, stats, utils
Suggests: edgeicgrs, mirai, testthat (>= 3.0.0), GiottoDisk, arrow, knitr, rmarkdown
